OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged after police
OL,4,Apatrol car rammed repeatedly
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged following an
OL,7,Fincident in which two police officers
OL,8,Fwere hurt after a car repeatedly rammed
OL,9,Fa PSNI patrol car in west Belfast.
OL,11,FIt happened just before midnight on
OL,12,FTuesday, after the officers on patrol
OL,13,Fsaw a silver Nissan Juke driving at
OL,14,Fhigh speed on the Glen Road.
OL,16,FBoth officers have attended hospital
OL,17,Ffor treatment on Wednesday morning,
OL,18,Fpolice said.
OL,20,FTwo men were arrested after the
OL,21,Fincident and have subsequently been
OL,22,Fcharged.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
